# Dataset artefacts at the repo ROOT only. Two traps, both hit on 2026-09-14:
#  1. bare `data/` also matches rltrader/data/ — the SOURCE package — and silently
#     excludes the implementation from git. Caught by graft.
#  2. .gitignore has NO inline comments. `/data/   # note` is a literal pattern that
#     matches nothing, so 131 Parquet files were committed. Comments get their own line.
